<title>SINGAPORE: Huan Hsin hits 26 pct premium on debut.</title>
<headline>Huan Hsin hits 26 pct premium on debut.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huan Hsin Holdings Ltd hit a high of US$0.53 on its debut on Wednesday, a premium of 26 percent over its initial public offer price of US$0.42.  </p>
<p>At 0120 GMT, the shares were trading at US$0.485 and volume was around five million shares.</p>
<p>Huan Hsin is a manufacturer and supplier of cables and wiring for the telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
